            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An abrasive article is provided, the abrasive article comprising a body. The body comprises at least 30 vol% and not greater than 90 vol% abrasive grains for a total volume of the body, wherein the abrasive grains are contained within a bond material comprising a metal. The body comprises at least 5 vol% and not greater than 40 vol% bond material for a total volume of the body. The bond material comprises at least 1 vol% and not greater than 40 vol% of an active bond composition of the total volume of the bond material, the active bond composition selected from the group of titanium, vanadium, chromium, zirconium, hafnium, tungsten, and a combination thereof, and further wherein the content (vol%) of abrasive grains is greater than the content of bond material. The body further comprises a porosity of at least 20 vol% and not greater than 60 vol%.</p>
            </abstract>
